# Machine-local MCP servers (absolute editor/tool paths). Copy
# .cursor/mcp.json.example to .cursor/mcp.json and replace the C:\Path\To\...
# placeholders with your Godot executable and this repo's
# tools/aseprite-mcp/build/index.js. The example uses cmd /c for Windows.
.cursor/mcp.json
